//
// COPY RULES (see COPY_AUDIT.md, approved 2026-09-12):
//   - Informal singular address in every locale: ты / tu / du / je / sen.
//   - No em dashes, no `·`, no `▲ ▼`, no `&` in prose.
//   - No "X. Not Y." antithesis headlines.
//   - The account and bank connection are PREMIUM and OPTIONAL. Never write
//     "no account ever" or "never connects to your bank" — write "not required"
//     and "only if you turn it on".
//   - 64 currencies (61 fiat + BTC/ETH/USDT). Never 13.
//   - French keeps U+202F (narrow no-break space) before : ; ? ! — no other locale does.
