// ---- FAQ (SEO): merged into the locales above. Rendered as <details> in the page
// and emitted as FAQPage JSON-LD by build.mjs (q1..q10). Missing locales fall back to `en`.
// q8 (price), q9 (bank details) and q10 (spreadsheet) exist to catch the
// "free budget planner", "budget app without bank" and "budget planner excel"
// query clusters. a1/a2 must stay honest about premium backup and bank sync.
